BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fi-incomes-register-separate-report@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=5
SUMMARY:Finland: Employer's separate report to the Incomes Register
DESCRIPTION:File the employer's separate report on health insurance contrib
 utions once a month\, by the fifth day of the calendar month following the
  payday month. Registered employers file it also for months without wages.
 \nApplies to: Employers paying wages (registered employers also for months
  with no wages)\nNon-working day: If the deadline falls on a Saturday\, Su
 nday or other holiday\, the data can be reported on the following business
  day.\n\nSource: https://www.vero.fi/en/businesses-and-corporations/taxes-
 and-charges/being-an-employer/how-to-report-wages-and-employers-contributi
 ons/\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#finland\n\
 nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurrin
 g rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sourc
 es last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#finland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fi-employer-contributions-payment@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=12
SUMMARY:Finland: Employer's contributions: monthly return and payment due d
 ate
DESCRIPTION:With a monthly tax period\, employer's contributions are filed 
 and paid by the 12th of the following month (e.g. the March return is due 
 12 April). Quarterly or extended periods follow a different cycle.\nApplie
 s to: Employers with a monthly tax period for employer's contributions\nNo
 n-working day: If the 12th falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or a public holida
 y\, the date is extended to the next business day.\n\nSource: https://www.
 vero.fi/en/About-us/contact-us/forms/filling-instructions/filing-and-payin
 g-vat-and-other-self-assessed-taxes--detailed-guidance/\nDetails: https://
 www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#finland\n\nFor information only\,
  not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the so
 urce\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 5 Octob
 er 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#finland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
